WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.160
Amazon offers a variety of self-service advertising solutions.

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:09.520
Understanding your business goals will help you select the right advertising products for your goals

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:13.120
and better analyze the performance of your ad campaigns.

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:17.600
Depending on your business goals, you may want to use different advertising solutions

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.140
in your advertising campaigns.

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:23.760
In this video, you'll learn how you can use Amazon ad solutions

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:26.080
to help meet your business objectives.

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:28.400
The customer's journey is rarely linear.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:33.440
Shoppers may move across different stages such as awareness, consideration, and purchase

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:35.634
as they navigate the Amazon store.

00:00:35.634 --> 00:00:38.560
Amazon ad solutions can help you meet objectives

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:43.040
that support shoppers at each stage of the journey, such as helping discover your brand,

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:45.329
browse your products, and drive purchases.

00:00:45.329 --> 00:00:48.000
Depending on your goals, your campaign strategy

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:48.555
may change.

00:00:48.555 --> 00:00:52.720
For example, if you're looking to help customers discover your brand, you may want to

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:58.080
create a sponsored display campaign with lifestyle audiences to reach customers that may be interested

00:00:58.080 --> 00:00:58.896
in your products.

00:00:58.896 --> 00:01:02.160
To help drive purchases with customers who are familiar with your brand,

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:07.120
you may want to use sponsored display with views remarketing audiences to remind customers of

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:08.786
products they may have previously considered.

00:01:08.786 --> 00:01:11.840
Let's talk through some more examples of how you can use

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:15.543
Amazon ad solutions to help achieve different business goals.

00:01:15.543 --> 00:01:17.600
Accent athletics have been selling

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:20.686
sportswear accessories in the Amazon store for two years.

00:01:20.686 --> 00:01:22.400
They've established a customer base,

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:26.867
but now are looking at expanding their business with more products and a wider audience.

00:01:26.867 --> 00:01:27.760
To do so,

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:32.202
Accent athletics is looking at Amazon ad solutions that can help them meet their business goals

00:01:32.202 --> 00:01:32.480
and

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:32.816
objectives.

00:01:32.816 --> 00:01:37.520
Their first goal is to reach more customers and build awareness around their brand

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:38.180
and products.

00:01:38.180 --> 00:01:42.800
To achieve this goal, they ran a sponsored brands campaign that can help customers

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:48.640
discover their brand and products with creative ads that appear in relevant Amazon shopping results.

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:54.320
Similarly, Accent athletics can also run a sponsored display campaign to help build brand awareness

00:01:54.320 --> 00:01:59.920
by promoting their products or a memorable brand story to customers while they shop or engage with

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:00.940
content they love.

00:02:00.940 --> 00:02:05.360
To gauge success, they look at how many impressions their ads drove indicating

00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:07.970
that the ads are displaying to their target audience.

00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:10.000
Their next business goal is to increase

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:14.725
traffic to their product detail pages, which could help more customers consider their brand and

00:02:14.725 --> 00:02:15.040
products.

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:19.920
They run a sponsored brands campaign that links to their own Amazon store using their best-selling

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:22.560
products to help engage customers as they browse.

00:02:22.560 --> 00:02:25.200
They review their product detail page views to

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:28.550
see if these ads are effective at meeting this goal.

00:02:28.550 --> 00:02:30.560
Lastly, Accent athletics is looking to

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:32.570
increase sales to grow their business.

00:02:32.570 --> 00:02:35.920
To achieve this goal, they use a sponsored products campaign

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:38.496
to help boost sales of individual products.

00:02:38.496 --> 00:02:41.440
With sponsored products ads, a single click takes

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:44.850
customers directly to the product detail page to make a purchase.

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:46.400
With their focus on growing

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:51.360
audience and driving traffic, they want to ensure that they are also helping drive purchases with

00:02:51.360 --> 00:02:52.107
the audience.

00:02:52.107 --> 00:02:56.960
Accent athletics can also consider a sponsored display campaign to help increase sales

00:02:56.960 --> 00:03:02.000
as it could help them easily discover, reach, and engage the right customers in the most relevant

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:03.971
context across their shopping journey.

00:03:03.971 --> 00:03:07.520
Similar to Accent athletics, you can use different Amazon

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:10.464
ad solutions to help meet your business goals.

00:03:10.464 --> 00:03:13.040
Amazon ads has billions of shopping, streaming,

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:18.400
and browsing signals to help connect your brand with the right customers at the right time in

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:21.935
brand-safe placements.

00:03:21.935 --> 00:03:26.647
Ready to get started?

00:03:26.647 --> 00:03:29.004
Visit ads.

00:03:29.004 --> 00:03:30.182
amazon.

00:03:30.182 --> 00:03:31.360
com.
